{"seq":20,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-recall-rerun-2026-11/zero-lean-opus-gbrain-conv-mu-v03-dev2/cr-03-thornbury-deadline-retraction/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-09T22:08:03.956Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"41e9c4d4e97477e1845850b9f80455899df12de9d81c82a69062aabacb47db34","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#central-team","text":"Thanks, Pree. I checked and couldn't confirm it. I can't see any account files for Thornbury Cloth Co., and the knowledge brain has nothing on them, so I have no order-form deadline to compare it with. For now I'd treat 23 May as hearsay. Also, if that means 23 May 2027, it's quite far off, so it's worth asking whether they meant a different date. The best way to pin it down is to get it in writing from your Thornbury contact, or to ask June Osei-Lark on the deal desk whether the order form has a deadline on file. Your message is logged here with \"unverified\" attached.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000130","thread_ts":"1791986400.000129"}}
{"seq":21,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-recall-rerun-2026-11/zero-lean-opus-gbrain-conv-mu-v03-dev2/cr-03-thornbury-deadline-retraction/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-09T22:08:07.870Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"41e9264b46d3d43abbdd457b84e6248559b1e51dfa7e621bae63aea78296a795","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","text":"I couldn't confirm the 23 May deadline for Thornbury Cloth Co. There are no Thornbury account files I can see, and searching the knowledge brain for \"Thornbury\" found nothing. So I have no order-form deadline to compare it with.\n\nI replied in your #central-team thread. In it I said:\n- We should treat 23 May as unverified until someone checks it.\n- If it means 23 May 2027, that's quite far off, so it's worth asking whether they meant a different date.\n- The best ways to pin it down are to get it in writing from your Thornbury contact, or to ask June Osei-Lark on the deal desk whether a deadline is on file.\n\nYour message stays in the channel record (and the brain, which saves channel messages automatically) marked as unverified, so I didn't log it a second time."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000131"}}
